mx - a minimal X11 terminal emulator.

Linux:
  deps: cairo fontconfig libxcb xcb-util-keysyms libxkbcommon freetype pkg-config
  make && ./bin/mx

OpenBSD:
  pkg_add cairo fontconfig libxcb xcb-util-keysyms libxkbcommon
  gmake && ./bin/mx

Test: make test   (gmake test on OpenBSD; needs a UTF-8 locale, e.g. LC_CTYPE=en_US.UTF-8)
